==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.33~0.67 seconds<sup>10f~20f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.33~0.67 seconds<sup>10f~20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Trolly Blogger]] (2,000%) spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**20 [[Trolly Blogger]]s (200%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Capy]] spawns.

==Strategies==
Only bring [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]] if they can outrange J.K. Bun Bun, or else they will not be able to stack well.

Cheaper meatshields are generally preferred - Capy and J.K. Bun Bun can both be expected to kill any meatshield in one hit, especially on higher Crown difficulties. [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]] and [[Kyubey Cat (Rare Cat)|Kyubey Cat]] are among the few exceptions, and should be strongly considered if you happen to own them.

